    "answer": {
      "short": "$21$",
      "worked": "Coefficient of $x^4$ in $(1-x)^4$: $\\binom{4}{4}(-1)^4=1$.\n\nCoefficient of $x^4$ in $(1-x)^5$: $\\binom{5}{4}(-1)^4=5$.\n\nCoefficient of $x^4$ in $(1-x)^6$: $\\binom{6}{4}(-1)^4=15$.\n\nTotal coefficient: $1+5+15=21$.",
